                                  "type": "text",
                                  "text": "Tisagenlecleucel cells dispersion for infusion for treating patients between two to 25 years of age (both ages inclusive) with B-cell acute lymphoblastic leukaemia that is refractory, in relapse post-transplant or in second or later relapse."
